a-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span> Sun <span class="aglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.4" cy="13.6" r="4"/><path d="M13.2 10.8 18.4 5.6"/></svg></span> conjunction <span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.7 4.6a3.3 3.3 0 0 0 6.6 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10.4" r="3.2"/><path d="M12 13.6v6M9 16.6h6"/></svg></span> Mercury · orb 0.2°</p><p>Your Sun is fused to your Mercury — the self and its narrator share a desk, which makes the account vivid and the distance between you and your own opinions small.</p></li><li><p class="mono"><span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 4.4a8 8 0 1 0 0 15.2 6.5 6.5 0 0 1 0-15.2Z"/></svg></span> Moon <span class="aglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.4" cy="13.6" r="4"/><path d="M13.2 10.8 18.4 5.6"/></svg></span> conjunction <span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.2 5v9.4"/><path d="M8 7.6h4.4"/><path d="M10.2 14.4c0 3.4 3.4 3.4 4.6 1.1"/></svg></span> Saturn · orb 0.2°</p><p>Your Moon is fused to your Saturn — your emotional life and your standards run as one instrument, hard to play separately.</p></li><li><p class="mono"><span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span> Sun <span class="aglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6.4" y="6.4" width="11.2" height="11.2" rx="0.6"/></svg></span> square <span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.6 10.2c0-4.2 6.2-4.2 6.2 0v9.6"/><path d="M9.3 16.3h6.6"/></svg></span> Jupiter · orb 1.2°</p><p>Your Sun grinds against your Jupiter — enthusiasm can stretch a promise beyond the time or energy available. Check the size of the commitment while there is still room to adjust it.</p></li><li><p class="mono"><span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 4.4a8 8 0 1 0 0 15.2 6.5 6.5 0 0 1 0-15.2Z"/></svg></span> Moon <span class="aglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4.5v15M5.5 8.25l13 7.5M18.5 8.25l-13 7.5"/></svg></span> sextile <span class="pglyph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.4" cy="13.6" r="4.7"/><path d="M13.8 10.2 19 5"/><path d="M14.7 5H19v4.3"/></svg></span> Mars · orb 1.5°</p><p>Your Moon has an open line to your Mars — your emotional life and your drive cooperate whenever you remember to ask.</p></li></ul></section></section>